# Whitelist: the mod's source, UE4SS settings, packaging, docs, the test log and the lab scripts. Never the game,
# decoded game data, saves/logs/screenshots, tools or build output.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/CLAUDE.md
!/AGENTS.md
!/docs/
!/Lab/
!/TailCoop/
TailCoop/cpp/build/
TailCoop/**/TailCoop.ini
TailCoop/**/launch.ini
*.log
*.png
